"nbxw9kv356wy": {
"body": "Summary: Between 9:24 AM PST on March 19 and 9:38 AM PST on March 19, the engineering team performed a database upgrade. During this window, users may have experienced degraded performance specifically on the Audiences Overview webpage.\n\nNotification Update:\nSome customers may have received automated email notifications citing \"Audience Run Failures\" during this time. Please be advised that these were false positives triggered by the maintenance; no actual failures occurred, and all background processes completed successfully.\n\nStatus:\nFunctionality was fully restored and all systems were confirmed stable as of 9:38 AM PST. We apologize for the inconvenience.",
